40 PRINT "in three voices"
50 A$="T120O4L4EEFGGFEDCCDEE.D8D2"
60 B$="T120O3L2EEDDEEDD"
70 C$="T120O3L2CCO2GGO3CCO2GG"
80 PLAY A$,B$,C$
90 ¦ÞºÌ}tA$="T120O4L4EEFGGFEDCCDED.C8C2"
100 B$="T120O3L2EEDDEEDC"
110 C$="T120O3L2CCO2GGO3CCO2GO3C"
120 PLAY A$,B$,C$
130 REM PLAY works in the background:
